  "measured_reason_for_failure": [
    "the confident tier alone is below the precision floor on held-out (0.2086) and full (0.2309) before any widening; every evaluated widening cutoff lowers precision further, so none of the evaluated configurations reaches 0.25 there (widening could only reach it with rows more precise than the confident tier, which no evaluated cutoff produced)",
    "bm25:ident's precision on held-out (0.2528) and full (0.2993) rests on abstention scored as precision 1 (abstention 0.1964 / 0.2456; precision over answered rows 0.0702 / 0.0711); corvint abstains on 0.0449 / 0.0636 of rows and its precision over answered rows is 0.1529 / 0.1620",
    "the fused, gated widening lifts coverage above bm25:ident on every split (held-out 0.2867 -> 0.4083 against 0.3857) and costs 0.018 precision on held-out",
    "dev PASS did not transfer: the dev repos' confident tier is more precise (0.2689) than the held-out repos' (0.2086); the gap is between repository sets, not between widening settings"
  ],
